	(784, 'Nora Roberts', 'Nora Roberts (born Eleanor Marie Robertson on October 10, 1950) is an American author of more than 225 romance novels. She writes as J. D. Robb for the in Death series and has also written under the pseudonyms Jill March and for publications in the U.K. as Sarah Hardesty.\r\n\r\nRoberts was the first author to be inducted into the Romance Writers of America Hall of Fame.', '1950-10-10'),
