	(849, 'Philip Ball', 'Philip Ball is a British science writer and editor. For over twenty years he has been an editor of the journal Nature for which he continues to write regularly. Besides articles for journals, magazines, and newspapers, he has authored books on science and broadcast on many occasions on radio and TV. - Wikipedia', NULL),
	(850, 'Elizabeth Adler', 'Born in Yorkshire, north England, Elizabeth Adler met in London her future husband, Richard, a American. They had lived in England, Ireland, France, Brazil, and USA. Today, the had one daughter and live in Palm Springs, California. Her first novel, Private Desires, launched an enormously successful writing career, she also wrote as Ariana Scott. She has now written over twenty internationally acclaimed bestsellers.', NULL),
