	(1289, 'Deborah R. Dolen', 'Discovered by Amazon in late 1999 Deborah Dolen has written over 1,000 DIY articles, 26 How to type books and directed several DIY Home and Garden type films.   Deborah Dolen now lives happily in South Florida with her rescue dog Ringo.  Ringo was a Katrina pup and they now spend time together at dog parks across the southern states.  Visit Deborah on Twitter, Flickr or the Mabel White Web Sites. Her most popular book is The Bathroom Chemist and can be found on Amazon here:  http://www.amazon.com/Bathroom-Chemist-Deborah-R-Dolen/dp/1894872010\r\n\r\nDeborah Dolen now focuses her time on environmental causes with emphasis on water issues world wide and helping people gain skill sets for occupation by donating her How to Videos to private and state owned vocation rehab centers.  Deborah Dolen is also very passionate about canine rescue.  Between her and her dog Ringo they had been through Ike, [together in Hou] Katrina & Wilma,[Ringo]  Bonnie, Frances, Charlie, Hugo  [Deborah Dolen Sarasota bay.]  See Deborah Dolen YouTube videos at:  http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K9Mc80kRYj8  \r\n\r\nVisit Ringo the Katrina Rescue Dog at his Twitter page @RingoDawg http://twitter.com/RingoDawg  or visit his web page http://www.deborahdolen.com/Ringo.htm .  His owner author Deborah Dolen is a gulf coast resident writing about the 2010 Gulf of Mexico oil spill.  See her writings on BlogSpot http://deborahdolen.blogspot.com/ \r\nhttp://deborahdolen.blogspot.com/2010/05/bp-oil-crises-let-dolphins-eat-cake-by.html and visit Deborah on Twitter http://twitter.com/DeborahDolen and http://www.deborahdolen.org which is where she covers the gulf coat oil spill from.\r\n\r\nJoin author Deborah Dolen on Facebook http://www.facebook.com/deborah.dolen MySpace   http://www.myspace.com/deborah_dolen Twitter http://twitter.com/DeborahDolen or BlogSpot http://deborahdolen.blogspot.com/   \r\n\r\nNewest Books written by Deborah Dolen The London Apothecary and Gracechurch wrote in London http://www.marthawhite2001.com/London_Apothecary_Book_by_Deborah_Dolen.htm http://www.mabelwhite.com/LondonApothecaryBook.htm\r\n\r\nSee my book reviews at:\r\nhttp://openlibrary.org/authors/OL3734536A/Deborah_R._Dolen http://www.paperbackswap.com/book/author/Deborah+R.+Dolen\r\nhttp://www.goodreads.com/author/show/323709.Deborah_R_Dolen http://www.reviewscout.com/Deborah-R.-Dolen\r\n\r\nAmazon at:\r\nhttp://www.amazon.com/s/?ie=UTF8&keywords=deborah+dolen&tag=googhydr-20&index=stripbooks&hvadid=1144971341&ref=pd_sl_3y02nz21ab_b', NULL),
