	(1836, 'Sheri S. Tepper', 'Sheri Stewart Tepper was an American writer of science fiction, horror and mystery novels. She is known for feminist science fiction, often with an ecofeminist slant. -Wikipedia\r\n\r\nShe also wrote murder mysteries under the pen names of [B.J. Oliphant][1] and [A. J. Orde][2], and a horror novel under [E.E. Horlak][3]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://openlibrary.org/authors/OL2724905A/B.J._Oliphant\r\n  [2]: https://openlibrary.org/authors/OL768769A/A._J._Orde\r\n  [3]: https://openlibrary.org/authors/OL2787259A/E.E._Horlak', '1929-07-16'),
