	(3040, 'Dave Wolverton', 'Dave Wolverton (born 30 May 1957), better known by his pen name David Farland is an American author, editor, and instructor of online writing workshops, and groups. He writes in several genres but is known best for his science fiction and fantasy works. His Runelords series have hit the New York Times bestsellers list. In 1987 he won the Writers of the Future contest, and has been nominated for a Nebula Award and a Hugo Award. He lived in St. George, Utah with his wife and five children and is best known for his novels, editing and online writing courses.', '1957-05-30'),
