	(3753, 'Jennifer Crusie', 'Jenny Crusie is the NYT bestselling author of twenty some novels and lots of other stuff. Her latest novel, Maybe This Time, hit shelves in August, 2010.\r\n\r\nJenny lives on the Ohio River where she often stares at the ceiling and counts her blessings.', NULL),
