	(4388, 'Laura Hillenbrand', 'Laura Hillenbrand is an American author of books and magazine articles. Her two best-selling nonfiction books, Seabiscuit: An American Legend and Unbroken: A World War II Story of Survival, Resilience, and Redemption have sold over 10 million copies, and each was adapted for film.\r\n\r\nSource: Wikipedia', '1967-05-15'),
