	(5106, 'Paul E. Miller', NULL, NULL),
	(5107, 'David R. Surette', 'David R. Surette’s new book of poetry is Easy to Keep, Hard to Keep In. published by Koenisha. His first Young Gentlemen’s School was released in 2004. Surette’s poems have been published in literary journals such as Peregrine and Salamander and appear in the anthologies French Connections: A Gathering of Franco-American Poets; Cadence of Hooves: A Celebration of Horses; and Look! Up In The Sky! - An Anthology of Comic Book Poetry.  He co-host Poetribe, a poetry series in East Bridgewater, Massachusetts.', NULL),
	(5108, 'Tim Powers', '**Tim Powers** is the author of fourteen novels, including The Anubis Gates, Declare, Hide Me Among the Graves, and On Stranger Tides, which was adapted for the fourth Pirates of the Caribbean movie of the same title. His novels have twice won the Philip K. Dick Award and the World Fantasy Award for Best Novel, and three times won Locus Awards. Powers lives with his wife, Serena, in San Bernardino, California.', NULL),
	(5109, 'Jo-Anne Christensen', NULL, NULL),
