	(112, 'Petals on the Wind', 'Petals on the Wind is a novel written by V. C. Andrews in 1980. It is the second book in the Dollanganger series. The timeline takes place from the siblings\' successful escape in November 1960 to the fall of 1975.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\n\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n[Flowers in the Attic / Petals on the Wind](https://openlibrary.org/works/OL16524231W)', NULL),
