	(238, 'CHRISTMAS KISSES', 'Linda Howard elebrates the holidays with a Mackenzie wedding--once Maris regains her memory, that is--in her new novella, "Mackenzie\'s Magic." Debbie Macomber bring those Manning men and the Manning sisters home for a mistletoe marriage as a single dad finally says "I do" in her exciting new story, "Silver Bells". The Wild West is where Priscilla Rawlings ties the knot at the Double D Ranch in Linda Turner\'s new tale, "A Wild West Christmas".', NULL),
