	(444, 'The Short Victorious War', 'Novel 3 of the Harrington Series.  Follows "The Honor of the Queen".  After almost a year to recover from the injuries suffered in the previous book, Honor is returned to command of a brand new battlecruiser.  She now has to face an overwhelming force as open warfare with Haven breaks out.  This novel is followed by "Field of Dishonor".', NULL),
