	(657, 'Famine of Horses, A (Missing Mystery, 14)', 'Carlisle in 1592 is one of the most dangerous parts of Queen Elizabeth\'s kingdom, where the law of the Scots gives way to the law of the English, often leaving gaps where there is no law at all. Sir Robert Carey, the new deputy warden of the West March, must solve a murder and avert a minor civil war.', NULL),
	(658, 'Washington City Streets', NULL, NULL),
	(659, 'Pokemon Complete Animation Guide', NULL, NULL),
