	(882, 'Castlevania', 'This is a strategy guide to the video game "Castlevaina: Symphony of the Night" for the PlayStation, PS, PS1, PS one, PSX}. It has many grey scale screenshots, and diagram style maps, of each part of the castle. It also has text describing how to complete each area, and find the game\'s various items, as well as tips and strategies for beating various enemies, and bosses. This book originally cost $12.95.', NULL),
