	(1091, 'Devil\'s Bride', 'Cynster #1\r\nWhen Devil, the most infamous member of the Cynster family, is caught in a compromising position with plucky governess Honoria Wetherby, he astonishes the entire ton by offering his hand in marriage. No one had dreamed this scandalous rake would so tamely take a bride. As society\'s mamas swooned at the loss of England\'s most eligible bachelor, Devil\'s infamous Cynster cousins began to place wagers on the wedding date.\r\n\r\nBut Honoria wasn\'t about to bend to society\'s demands and marry a man just because they\'d been found together unchaperoned. No. She craved adventure. Solving the murder of a young Cynster cousin fit the bill for a while, but once the crime was solved, Honoria was set on seeing the world. But the scalding heat of her unsated desire for Devil soon had Honoria craving a very different sort of excitement. Could her passion for Devil cause her to embrace the enchanting peril of a lifelong adventure of the heart?\r\n\r\nCynster Series:\r\nThe Promise in a Kiss (Cynster, #0.5)\r\nDevil\'s Bride (Cynster, #1)\r\nA Rake\'s Vow (Cynster, #2)\r\nScandal\'s Bride (Cynster, #3)\r\nA Rogue\'s Proposal (Cynster, #4)\r\nA Secret Love (Cynster, #5)\r\nAll About Love (Cynster, #6)\r\nAll About Passion (Cynster, #7)\r\nOn a Wild Night (Cynster, #8)\r\nOn a Wicked Dawn (Cynster, #9)\r\nLost and Found (Cynster, #9.5)\r\nThe Perfect Lover (Cynster, #10)\r\nThe Ideal Bride (Cynster, #11)\r\nThe Truth About Love (Cynster, #12)\r\nWhat Price Love? (Cynster, #13)\r\nThe Taste of Innocence (Cynster, #14)\r\nTemptation and Surrender (Cynster, #15)\r\n\r\nCynster Sisters Trilogy:\r\nViscount Breckenridge to the Rescue (Cynster #16; The Cynster Sisters Trilogy, #1 )\r\nIn Pursuit of Eliza Cynster (Cynster, #17; The Cynster Sisters Trilogy, #2)\r\nThe Capture of the Earl of Glencrae (Cynster, #18; The Cynster Sisters Trilogy, #3)\r\n\r\nThe Cynster Sisters Duo:\r\nAnd Then She Fell (Cynster, #19; The Cynster Sisters Duo, #1)\r\nThe Taming of Ryder Cavanaugh (Cynster, #20; The Cynster Sisters Duo, #2)\r\n\r\nCynster Next Generation:\r\nBy Winter\'s Light  (Cynsters Next Generation, #1)\r\nThe Tempting of Thomas Carrick (Cynster Next Generation, #2)\r\nA Match for Marcus Cynster (Cynsters Next Generation, #3)\r\nThe Lady By His Side (Devil\'s Brood Trilogy, #1; Cynster Next Generation, #4)\r\nAn Irresistible Alliance (Devil\'s Brood Trilogy, #2; Cynster Next Generation, #5)\r\nThe Greatest Challenge of Them All ( Cynster Next Generation #6)\r\nA Conquest Impossible to Resist (Cynster Next Generation #7)\r\nThe Inevitable Fall of Christopher Cynster (Cynster Next Generation, #8)\r\nThe Games Lovers Play (Cynster Next Generation, #9)\r\nThe Secrets of Lord Grayson Child (Cynster Next Generation, #10)\r\nFoes, Friends and Lovers (Cynsters Next Generation #11)\r\nThe Time for Love (Cynsters Next Generation #12)\r\nRelated:\r\nHero, Come Back (Contains- "Lost and Found" Cynster, #9.5)(Governess Brides, #6.5)', NULL),
