	(1181, 'The Legend of Zelda', 'This is a hints, tips, and strategy guide to the adventure, video game "The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time" for the Nintendo 64 {N64}. It has many color screenshots, various illustrations, and diagram style maps of each area. It has tips on fighting the games various enemies, and bosses. There are also explatations on how to find the various items, and weapons in the game. The book originally cost $9.99 in the USA, $14.95 in Canada, and £8.95 in the UK.', NULL),
