	(1295, 'The Bedroom Business (Harlequin Presents No. 2159 (Passion)', 'Jake McBride is a self-made millionaire, brilliant at business, talented in bed-and cynical about women. Emily Taylor is his personal assistant, terrific in the office...and an innocent when it comes to the opposite sex!But when Jake teaches Emily how to transform herself from shy secretary into sexy siren, he loses his grip on his legendary cool. If she\'s going to lose her virginity, it has to be to him!', NULL),
