	(1541, 'The Life of Our Lord', '**In this charming, simple retelling of the life of Jesus Christ, adapted from the Gospel of St. Luke, Dickens hoped to teach his young children about religion and faith.**---Goodreads\r\n\r\n**The author of such works as "Oliver Twist" and "A Christmas Carol" retells the story of Jesus Christ, for his own children.**--LibraryThing', NULL),
