	(1580, 'Behind rebel lines', 'This book is the true story of how Emma Edmonds pretended to be a boy so she could be a field nurse for the Union. But she wanted to do more than that, so she decided to become a spy. She had a lot of adventures as a spy, and even made a few new friends along the way.', NULL),
	(1581, 'MCTS Self-Paced Training Kit (Exam 70-526): Microsoft® .NET Framework 2.0 Windows®-Based Client Development', 'Skill-building exercises, lesson summaries, and review questions help you prepare for the Microsoft Certified Technology Specialist (MCTS) exam on Microsoft .NET 2.0 Windows-based client development. Covers all exam objectives.The Adobe Reader format of this title is not suitable for use on the Pocket PC or Palm OS versions of Adobe Reader.', NULL),
