	(1812, 'Out', 'In the Tokyo suburbs four women work the draining graveyard shift at a boxed-lunch factory. Burdened with chores and heavy debts and isolated from husbands and children, they all secretly dream of a way out of their dead-end lives.', NULL),
	(1813, 'Make him look good', 'Ricky, a rising Latin music star, pursues his career in Miami\'s hotspots and is orbited by six women, including his plus-sized publicist, a club owner, his pregnant wife, and a media-hungry fellow singer.', NULL),
