	(2135, 'Cycle of the Werewolf', 'A werewolf is stalking Tarker\'s Mills and only young, wheelchair-bound Marty Coslaw suspects the truth. He enlists the help of his black sheep uncle to identify the shape shifter and destroy him.\r\n\r\n([source][1])\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://stephenking.com/library/novel/cycle_of_the_werewolf.html', NULL),
