	(2401, 'The Snow Leopard', 'This lovely book (1978) describes a two month search for the snow leopard with naturalist George Schaller in the Dolpo region of Nepal.  The book combines the search for the snow leopard with a search for inner meaning (Zen Buddism)', NULL),
