	(2495, '16 Lighthouse Road', 'Welcome to Cedar Cove - a small town with a big heart!Judge Olivia Lockheart has caused a scandal. Hearing Cecilia and Ian Randal\'s petition for a divorce, she came to the conclusion that the young couple hadn\'t tried hard enough to make their marriage work. Her judgement? Divorce denied. While Judge Olivia throws the town into an uproar, her daughter Justine is on the verge of the biggest decision of her life. Should she stop waiting for love and accept a marriage of convenience? Olivia\'s best friend, Grace, has troubles of her own. Dan, her husband, is increasingly distant and Grace is starting to wonder if he\'s having an affair.And in Cedar Cove, nothing stays secret for long. Make time for friends. Make time for Debbie Macomber.', NULL),
