	(2599, 'Restoring Hope', 'Perhaps the most prominent public intellectual of our time, Cornel West asks nine of America\'s most influential artists, scholars, and public figures about the sources of hope among African Americans today: "How can we be realistic about what this nation is about and still sustain hope, acknowledging that we\'re up against so much?"', NULL),
