	(3612, 'One Knight Only', 'King Arthur--in his modern incarnation as Arthur Penn--has been elected President of the United States. But with political power comes powerful enemies. An assassination attempt against Arthur puts his beloved wife Gwen in a coma--and her only hope lies in the lost Holy Grail.', NULL),
	(3613, 'The act of marriage', 'The art of mutually enjoyable lovemaking is not difficult to learn, but neither is it automatic. No one is a good lover by nature, yet no one need settle for a lifetime of sexual frustration. Tim and Beverly LaHaye offer principles, goals, guidelines, charts, and research results to help couples achieve the satisfying relationship every person anticipates when he says, "I do." - Back cover.', NULL),
