	(3838, 'The Ancient Secret of the Flower of Life', 'A definitive and essential guide to the New Age creation theory, utilising ancient knowledge and groundbreaking scientific discovery to bring light onto the truth about our universe, and what events are in store. Melchizedek takes the reader on a phenomenal spiritual journey through Atlantis, Ancient Egypt and modern day society in a way that continues to inspire countless readers today.', NULL),
