	(4230, 'Objection!', 'A compelling, intelligent and gutsy read, OBJECTION! captures Nancy’s inimitable voice that has become a source of insight to millions of television viewers and radio listeners around the country. OBJECTION!  will provide an in-depth, yet accessible and entertaining, look at the inner workings of the US judicial system, and give insightful criticisms of how the media has the power to manipulate and shape court decisions.', NULL),
	(4231, 'The perfect Manhattan', 'Confronted by staggering student loans and an ambition to be a screenwriter, Cassie takes a job as a bartender at a popular SoHo nightspot, until a summer job in the Hamptons hurtles her into the midst of celebrities, wealth, and scandal.', NULL),
	(4232, 'The Worldly Philosophers', '"The Worldly Philosophers is a bestselling classic that not only enables us to see more deeply into our history but helps us better understand our own times. In this seventh edition, Robert L. Heilbroner provides a view theme that connects thinkers as diverse as Adam Smith and Karl Marx. The theme is the common focus of their highly varied ideas - namely, the search to understand how a capitalist society works."--BOOK JACKET.', NULL),
